OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer in hospital after
OL,4,Abeing shot in Nottingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer is being treated in
OL,7,Fhospital after being shot in Nottingham
OL,8,Fcity centre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the officer
OL,11,Fhad approached two suspects in Angel
OL,12,FRow shortly before 04:50 BST on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe officer is now being treated for a
OL,15,Fwound to his foot, the force added.
OL,17,FDetectives said a firearm was recovered
OL,18,Fand that two suspects, a man and a
OL,19,Fwoman, fled the scene.
